  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nCP = ₹605\n\nGain% = 37%\n\nDiscount = 45%\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nSP = CP × (1 + Gain%)\n\n= 605 × (1 + 37/100)\n\n= 605 × 1.37 = ₹828.85\n\nSP = MP × (1 - 45/100)\n\n⇒ SP = MP × 0.55\n\n828.85 = MP × 0.55\n\nMP = 828.85 / 0.55\n\nMP = ₹1507\n\n**∴ The Marked Price of the oven is ₹1507.**",
